(text "J201 takes the side-link flex from main-board J2001: J2001 pin n reaches J201 pin 25 - n.\nPin 13 grounds SIDE_PRESENT_N. CM5_HOST follows VBUS_EN, so the main board routes its hub upstream to the CM5\nonce the CM5 powers its USB ports; R201 limits the current while HOST_EXT holds CM5_HOST low on the main board." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.4 160.02 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "280b833c-ea85-4d73-9a79-5e22201b1556"))
